   "text": "I can speak to him in the valley. I can receive kindness while questions remain. I place the day behind me and the day before me within his care. Tonight, I am learning to trust him with what I cannot carry. Choose one unfinished concern from today. Name it simply, without opening the whole story again. Then pray: Shepherd, I place this in your care for tonight. If a practical step belongs to tomorrow, you can take it when tomorrow arrives. For now, let that one concern rest beside this one prayer. You have given it a name, and you have brought it to God.",
